    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 20250609</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250609/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 09 Jun 2025 11:37:59 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_20250609/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output value of &lt;code&gt;counter&lt;/code&gt; in the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;package main&#xA;&#xA;import &amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&#xA;&#xA;func main() {&#xA;&#x9;var m = map[string]int{&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&amp;#34;A&amp;#34;: 21,&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&amp;#34;B&amp;#34;: 22,&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&amp;#34;C&amp;#34;: 23,&#xA;&#x9;}&#xA;&#x9;counter := 0&#xA;&#x9;for k, v := range m {&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;if counter == 0 {&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;&#x9;delete(m, &amp;#34;A&amp;#34;)&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;}&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;counter&amp;#43;&amp;#43;&#xA;&#x9;&#x9;fmt.Println(k, v)&#xA;&#x9;}&#xA;&#x9;fmt.Println(&amp;#34;counter is &amp;#34;, counter)&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;A. 2&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;B. 3&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;C. 2 or 3&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p&gt;C&#xA;&lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/play/p/-OKOFSeE6GS&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;external nofollow noopener noreferrer&#34;&gt;Go Online Run&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;The iteration order of &lt;code&gt;for range map&lt;/code&gt; is unordered. If &lt;code&gt;A&lt;/code&gt; is encountered in the first iteration, the output is 3; otherwise, it is 2.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Go Daily Question 086</title>
      <link>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_086/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 06 Dec 2024 20:45:12 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://loommii.github.io/en/go_practise/go_daily_question_086/</guid>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/godailyquestion/">GoDailyQuestion</category>
      <category domain="https://loommii.github.io/en/categories/golanguagebasics/">GoLanguageBasics</category>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;What is the output of the following code?&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;func main() {&#xA;    m := map[int]string{0:&amp;#34;zero&amp;#34;,1:&amp;#34;one&amp;#34;}&#xA;    for k,v := range m {&#xA;        fmt.Println(k,v)&#xA;    }&#xA;}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&#xA;&lt;details&gt;&#xA;  &lt;summary&gt;🔑 Answer Analysis:&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;  &lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;0 zero&#xA;1 one&#xA;// Or&#xA;1 one&#xA;0 zero&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;The output of a map is unordered.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
